sub login | Authenticate to a shithub host
sub logout | Remove a stored credential for a shithub host
sub refresh | Re-authenticate to rotate or expand scopes on the active hos
sub setup-git | Configure git to use shithub as a credential helper
sub status | Show authentication status for each configured shithub host
sub switch | Switch the default shithub host
sub token | Print the authenticated token for a host
flag -h --help | help for auth
